flowchart TD
  A[Find transfer and select tracking scope] --> B[Scan and review draft quantities]
  B --> C[Confirm receipt]
  C --> D{Submission outcome}
  D -->|Confirmed| E[Read back saved quantities]
  E --> F{Refresh succeeded?}
